        "notes": "Resolves @ok-ggwp/git-gloss/package.json (the package has no exports map, so it's resolvable) and runs its bin with the same Node. The 'not found' message now says how to get it. Only a missing package (MODULE_NOT_FOUND) falls back to PATH; any other resolution error is raised, so a broken install isn't silently replaced by a different git-gloss (the reviews found the bare catch hid it)."
      },
